60#issuecomment-12456332","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netty/netty/issues/960","id":12456332,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDEyNDU2MzMy","user":{"login":"fbettag","id":79918,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5OTE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/79918?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbettag","html_url":"https://github.com/fbettag","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbettag/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbettag/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbettag/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbettag/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbettag/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbettag/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbettag/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbettag/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbettag/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2013-01-19T15:40:12Z","updated_at":"2013-01-19T15:40:12Z","body":"```\n    val chan = srv.group(new NioEventLoopGroup)\n      .localAddress(addr)\n      .channel(classOf[NioDatagramChannel])\n      .handler(TrafficHandler)\n      .option[java.lang.Integer](ChannelOption.SO_RCVBUF, 1500)\n      .option[java.lang.Integer](ChannelOption.UDP_RECEIVE_PACKET_SIZE, 1500)\n    srv.bind().sync\n```\n\nUnknown channel option: UDP_RECEIVE_PACKET_SIZE=1500\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netty/netty/issues/comments/12456332/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"fbettag","id":79918,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5OTE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/79918?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbettag